,"unit":"c. à s.","have":false},{"name":"vinaigre de riz","plural":"vinaigre de riz","qty":1,"unit":"c. à s.","have":false},{"name":"gingembre","plural":"gingembre","qty":1,"unit":"c. à c.","have":false},{"name":"ail","plural":"ails","qty":1,"unit":"gousse","have":false},{"name":"graines de sésame","plural":"graines de sésame","qty":1,"unit":"c. à s.","have":false},{"name":"huile d'olive","plural":"huile d'olive","qty":1,"unit":"c. à s.","have":false}],"steps":[{"text":"Mélange la sauce soja, le miel, le vinaigre, le gingembre et l'ail.","timer":null},{"text":"Fais dorer le poulet en morceaux dans l'huile 8 min.","timer":{"label":"Poêle","min":8}},{"text":"Verse la sauce et laisse caraméliser 5 min en enrobant bien le poulet.","timer":{"label":"Poêle","min":5}},{"text":"Parsème de sésame et sers avec du riz.","timer":null}],"kids":true},{"title":"Fajitas au poulet","intro":"Des lanières de poulet et de poivrons épicées, roulées dans des tortillas.","minutes":25,"calories":520,"difficulty":"Facile","imageSearch":"chicken fajitas","veg":false,"oven":false,"cold":false,"missing":"","origin":"Plat tex-mex","serves":4,"items":[{"name":"blanc de poulet","plural":"blancs de poulet","qty":3,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"poivron rouge","plural":"poivrons rouges","qty":1,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"poivron vert","plural":"poivrons verts","qty":1,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"oignon","plural":"oignons","qty":1,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"tortilla","plural":"tortillas","qty":8,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"épices fajitas","plural":"épices fajitas","qty":2,"unit":"c. à s.","have":false},{"name":"crème fraîche","plural":"crèmes fraîche","qty":10,"unit":"cl","have":false},{"name":"huile d'olive","plural":"huile d'olive","qty":2,"unit":"c. à s.","have":false},{"name":"sel","plural":"sels","qty":null,"unit":"","have":false}],"steps":[{"text":"Coupe le poulet, les poivrons et l'oignon en lanières.","timer":null},{"text":"Fais dorer le poulet dans l'huile avec les é